# Build a Complete B2B Prospecting, Data Distribution & Sales Operations CRM

Build a professional, modern, full-stack web application for a B2B lead generation, prospecting, cold calling, LinkedIn outreach, email outreach, and appointment-setting company.

The purpose of this system is to replace our current manual operations, where data managers download company and contact data from Apollo or other sources, manually analyze and filter the data using AI, distribute Excel sheets to sales representatives, and then have no central system to track which companies have been contacted, what happened, who is working on which company, or whether appointments were booked.

We want one centralized application that manages the entire workflow from data collection and importing, campaign creation, data distribution, prospecting, follow-ups, appointment setting, employee management, and reporting.

## 1. Technology Stack

Build this using:

- Frontend: Next.js with App Router
- Language: TypeScript
- UI: Tailwind CSS
- Components: shadcn/ui
- Icons: Lucide
- Backend: Next.js API routes or a clean backend architecture
- Database: PostgreSQL
- ORM: Prisma
- Authentication: Secure authentication with session management
- Charts: Recharts
- Excel/CSV Import: Support Excel, CSV and bulk file uploads
- Responsive design: Desktop-first but fully responsive

The application should be self-hostable on a VPS using Docker.

Build a real functional application, not just static screens or a UI prototype. All forms, buttons, filters, imports, actions, dashboards and workflows must connect to the database and function properly.

